[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033] STEP PURPOSE
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033] --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   step_10: the proper clock-channel decomposition.
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   The previous tests measured cap membership on the raw osc->orig
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   correction -- dominated by Jupiter's kick.  The proper TEP observable is
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   the NON-PLANETARY part of the correction, tested through channels where
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   planets and a proper-time boundary predict different signs:
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   P1 rotation-per-kick: ddir/|D(1/a)| -- gravity rotates the orbit in
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   proportion to the energy exchanged; a lapse boundary rotates the
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   reconstruction without exchanging energy.  Ratio isolates the
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   non-planetary rotation.
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   P2 inbound vs outbound: D(orig->future) vs theta_orig vs theta_fut.
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   An ingress boundary leaves the discrepancy tied to the ARRIVAL
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   direction; planets leave it directionless on both legs.
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   P3 CMB-frame motion: continuous correlation of the correction with
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   the comet's velocity projection along the CMB dipole and the ISM
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   inflow -- the field's rest frame, not a cap.
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   P4 rotation-axis coherence: the unit vector of each comet's
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   orbit-plane rotation (p_orig x p_osc).  Boundary crossing rotates
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   about a shared axis; planetary kicks rotate about scattered axes.
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   P5 NG residuals: A1 (radial), A2 (transverse), A3 (normal) recoil
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   components vs axis -- out-of-plane A3 excess = a push normal to
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   the orbital plane, the domain-wall signature.
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   P6 epoch trend: correction vs perihelion year -- a moving boundary.
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   Data: Warsaw catalogue tables a1/b/b4/c/d (Krolikowska 2014), all real.
[2026-09-21 14:35:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 033]   Pre-declared: axis (lam 34, beta -13), cap 60 deg, spike 0<1/a<100e-6.
